    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/3b4f197a5f202ae640146155a6c08f47.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROJECT LEVELS</strong> uses an <strong>entirely code-free editor</strong> that allows <strong>anyone</strong> to unleash their creativity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implement <strong>advanced features</strong> like <strong>gravity &amp; time manipulations</strong>, <strong>triggers</strong>, <strong>animations</strong> &amp; <strong>events</strong> <strong>within a few minutes</strong> thanks to the <strong>clear &amp; intuitive UI</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/cb3eeb195e5d3ebdbc251a2156e4ed44.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/65ba52c01e754931facc29b2665ee915.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While creating a level, you can <strong>mark properties and values as &quot;editable&quot;</strong> to allow users to modify them by using <strong>&quot;edit mode&quot;</strong> with the TAB key while playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>unique gameplay feature</strong> allows for a <strong>never-seen-before level of interaction</strong> between players and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/bc63d3bbeab6a7978df8f8bc50fa37b7.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/f2a4b6491d0632abce951aa93ef8801b.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share and download levels to and from the Steam Workshop with just a few clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/ef760d83fd026cd322bbbf3bc18e615b.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/8610b5d7ab3e5ee0c502b09e36564e7f.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROJECT LEVELS is a game born from my desire of allowing anyone, whatever their experience is, to show a piece of their imagination to as many people as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/8bd7becd95bfb935e6c057fd44985726.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/2c44456d6b732e30fa950f2febd46b36.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game editor was designed so that wannabe game developers can have a rough idea of how an advanced level editor works to then transition to real game engines with more confidence and ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/1e23d0ccd65bf9e9423c896e49b034bf.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah... i didn't have anything for the &quot;E&quot;...<br>PROJECT LEVELS - 2025 / Designed and Created by Fili</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/3b4f197a5f202ae640146155a6c08f47.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROJECT LEVELS</strong> uses an <strong>entirely code-free editor</strong> that allows <strong>anyone</strong> to unleash their creativity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implement <strong>advanced features</strong> like <strong>gravity &amp; time manipulations</strong>, <strong>triggers</strong>, <strong>animations</strong> &amp; <strong>events</strong> <strong>within a few minutes</strong> thanks to the <strong>clear &amp; intuitive UI</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/cb3eeb195e5d3ebdbc251a2156e4ed44.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/65ba52c01e754931facc29b2665ee915.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While creating a level, you can <strong>mark properties and values as &quot;editable&quot;</strong> to allow users to modify them by using <strong>&quot;edit mode&quot;</strong> with the TAB key while playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>unique gameplay feature</strong> allows for a <strong>never-seen-before level of interaction</strong> between players and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/bc63d3bbeab6a7978df8f8bc50fa37b7.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/f2a4b6491d0632abce951aa93ef8801b.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share and download levels to and from the Steam Workshop with just a few clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/ef760d83fd026cd322bbbf3bc18e615b.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/8610b5d7ab3e5ee0c502b09e36564e7f.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROJECT LEVELS is a game born from my desire of allowing anyone, whatever their experience is, to show a piece of their imagination to as many people as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/8bd7becd95bfb935e6c057fd44985726.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/2c44456d6b732e30fa950f2febd46b36.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game editor was designed so that wannabe game developers can have a rough idea of how an advanced level editor works to then transition to real game engines with more confidence and ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848520/extras/1e23d0ccd65bf9e9423c896e49b034bf.avif?t=1754095979\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah... i didn't have anything for the &quot;E&quot;...<br>PROJECT LEVELS - 2025 / Designed and Created by Fili</p>",
